    <div class="itdgl-clinic-intro">
      <p>Website + online booking + WhatsApp Cloud API for a haircare + trichology clinic in Pune, Maharashtra must handle long-cycle patient nurture — first inquiry to booked consultation often 2-8 weeks. WhatsApp long-cycle flows + educational email + retargeting layer critical. This FAQ answers 12 questions Pune trichology clinics ask about website + booking.</p>
