    <div class="itdgl-evidence-band">
      <strong>ITD CLINIC MARKETING &mdash; WHAT WE ACTUALLY DO:</strong>
      ITD GrowthLabs runs full-stack digital marketing for haircare + trichology + hair loss clinics across Thane, Mumbai, Navi Mumbai, Dombivli, Kalyan, Nagpur, Nashik, and Pune. Social media management + Reels + viral content, Meta + Google ads, website + online booking + WhatsApp Cloud API integration, Google Business Profile optimisation + local SEO, and patient lead generation. We work with clinics that don't have in-house marketing teams — treating the marketing function as an outsourced growth partner, not a vendor. Every answer below reflects live clinic work.
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-faq-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What does a modern haircare + trichology clinic website in Pune include?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Similar to dermatology + trichology-specific: (1) Trichologist profile + credentials, (2) Hair-loss assessment quiz (interactive — pattern + severity + duration + prior treatments), (3) PRP + GFC + mesotherapy procedure pages with pricing + FAQ, (4) Before-after growth timeline gallery (6-12 month documentation with consent + disclaimer), (5) Booking + video-consultation integration (many hair-loss patients prefer initial video consult), (6) WhatsApp Cloud API long-cycle nurture, (7) Blog on hair-loss science + treatment options + patient journeys, (8) LocalBusiness + MedicalBusiness + FAQ + Article schema. In Pune multilingual essential.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How much does a trichology clinic website cost in Pune?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Boutique Rs 60K-1.5L (3-5 weeks). Mid-market Rs 1.5-3.5L (5-8 weeks). Enterprise Rs 3.5-8L+ (8-14 weeks). Maintenance Rs 15K-60K/month. Bundled with retainer.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What booking system integrations work for a Pune trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Cliniify + Practo + Bookinginfo + custom. Key trichology-specific: video-consultation option (many hair-loss patients start with video before in-person visit), hair-loss assessment quiz pre-consultation, WhatsApp long-cycle follow-up + PRP/GFC session scheduling + reminder + progress-check-in.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does WhatsApp Cloud API work for a Pune trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Interakt/AiSensy Cloud API — long-cycle nurture flows: welcome + hair-loss assessment + educational content + video-consultation booking + confirmation + reminder + post-consultation follow-up + treatment plan discussion + weekly during 6-12 month PRP/GFC treatment + progress documentation + retention. Rs 3-15K/month + per-message. Marathi + Hindi + English + Gujarati native templates.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Should we use WordPress, Shopify, or custom?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">WordPress + plugins most common for trichology (Rs 60K-1.5L). Shopify if adding hair-product sales alongside consultation. Custom for multi-location + advanced patient portal + treatment tracking.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What Core Web Vitals + SEO essentials for trichology clinic websites?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Same as dermatology + trichology-specific: hair-loss educational content (comprehensive silo — androgenetic + telogen + alopecia + PRP + GFC + mesotherapy + hair transplant comparison), long-form YouTube video embeds, patient journey documentation, blog for AI search citation. In Pune multilingual.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we handle before-after growth documentation + consent?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Signed consent + 6-12 month growth documentation with same lighting/angle/time + disclaimer + individual-variation caveat. Categorised by hair-loss type + treatment protocol. Consent revocable.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What booking conversion rate for a Pune trichology clinic website?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">5-10% booking-inquiry conversion (higher than dermatology due to concentrated hair-loss intent). First-time 3-6%. Returning 10-18%. Referral 15-25%. Video consultation option adds 20-40% booking conversion.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we integrate reviews for trichology clinic website?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Same as dermatology + trichology-specific: long-cycle patient success stories (with consent) + PRP/GFC journey documentation + video testimonials + review generation programme. Target 25-80 Google reviews/year.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What ongoing maintenance for trichology clinic website?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Rs 15-60K/month + content updates + long-cycle patient journey documentation additions + PRP/GFC before-after gallery growth + blog + Core Web Vitals audit. Bundled with retainer.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What common website mistakes do Pune trichology clinics make?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Same as dermatology + trichology-specific: no video-consultation option, weak hair-loss educational silo, no long-cycle nurture WhatsApp flow, missing 6-12 month before-after growth documentation, no long-form YouTube integration.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does ITD build trichology clinic websites in Pune?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Full-stack: mobile-first + Core Web Vitals + hair-loss assessment quiz + video-consultation booking + WhatsApp long-cycle nurture + before-after growth gallery + reviews + schema + multilingual + local SEO. Timeline 3-8 weeks. Post-launch bundled with marketing retainer (Rs 40,000-3 lakh).</div>
      </div>
